ta","data":[{"unit":1,"title":3,"area":182,"prev":184,"next":187,"titles":190,"firmware":33},{"id":2,"title":3,"aliases":4,"area":12,"order":13,"path":14,"context":15,"summary":24,"status":25,"firmware":26,"facts":36,"procedures":94,"parameters":137,"related":138,"body":143,"sources":144,"official_url":45,"controls":158},"sequencer.parameter-locks","Parameter locks",[5,6,7,8,9,10,11],"p-lock","p-locks","plock","parameter lock","locked parameter","step automation","per-step value","sequencer",30,"knowledge/manual/units/sequencer/parameter-locks.md",{"modes":16,"screens":19},[17,18],"instrument","auxiliary",[20,21,22,23],"M1","M2","M3","M4","Store a module-page value on individual steps; whenever such a step plays, the parameter jumps to the stored value.","current",{"min":27,"changed_in":28,"guide_version":34,"verified_on":35},"1.0.9",[29,30,31,32,33],"1.0.15","1.1.0","1.1.3","1.1.21","1.1.33","1.1.15",null,[37,42,47,50,54,58,61,64,68,72,76,80,84,88,91],{"id":38,"text":39,"source":40,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":33,"confidence":41},"record","To lock a value, keep a step held and turn an encoder; the step remembers the value you dial in.","docs/research/59-screen-profiling.md#28-bar-steps","verified",{"id":43,"text":44,"source":45,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"playback","Each time the sequencer reaches a locked step, the parameter takes that step's stored value.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/sequencer#step-sequencing","official",{"id":48,"text":49,"source":45,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"scope","Any parameter on the four module pages can carry locks; the settings of players cannot.",{"id":51,"text":52,"source":53,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"stepped","By default the value jumps at each locked step. The shape control in the bar menu (`bar + turn E4`) smooths the movement between locks.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/sequencer#extend-with-bar",{"id":55,"text":56,"source":57,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"live-automation","Knob moves recorded live while holding `record` are also stored step by step, so they play back stepped until you add smoothing.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/sequencer#live-recording",{"id":59,"text":60,"source":45,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"copy","Copying a step to an empty step brings its locks along with its notes and step components.",{"id":62,"text":63,"source":53,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"clear-pattern","`bar + M2` removes every lock in the pattern and leaves the notes in place.",{"id":65,"text":66,"source":67,"firmware_min":29,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"clear-track","Clearing the whole track with `record + hold stop` removes its locks too.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.0.15",{"id":69,"text":70,"source":71,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"skip-component","The skip parameter lock step component (`natural 12`) lets a step's locks play only on every Nth pass, for automation that appears once every few repeats.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/step-components",{"id":73,"text":74,"source":75,"firmware_min":30,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"samplers","Tracks using the drum or synth sampler accept locks as well.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.1.0",{"id":77,"text":78,"source":79,"firmware_min":31,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"duplicate-bar","Duplicating a bar with `bar + shift + [+]` copies its locks and step components too.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.1.3",{"id":81,"text":82,"source":83,"firmware_min":32,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"rotate","Shifting a track's sequence with `Tn + [-]/[+]` moves the locks together with the notes.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.1.21",{"id":85,"text":86,"source":87,"firmware_min":33,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"empty-steps","A lock can sit on a step that has no note; before OS 1.1.33 a bug prevented adding one there.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.1.33",{"id":89,"text":90,"source":40,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":33,"confidence":41},"lock-box","While you record a lock, the held step's number box on the screen turns orange.",{"id":92,"text":93,"source":40,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":33,"confidence":41},"show-locks","Holding a locked step shows its locked values in the page's top bar instead of the track's own — shape 00 and detune 06, say, on a track set to 15 and 05.",[95,106,115,122,129],{"id":96,"goal":97,"preconditions":98,"steps":101,"result":105,"source":45,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"add","Lock a parameter value on one step",[99,100],"the track is selected","the module page with the parameter is on screen",[102],{"keys":103,"note":104,"set":35},"step n + turn E1…E4","keep holding the step while turning; any page parameter works","The step plays back with the new value from now on.",{"id":107,"goal":108,"preconditions":109,"steps":111,"result":114,"source":57,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"record-live","Record knob movements into the pattern while it plays",[110],"the pattern is playing",[112],{"keys":113,"note":35,"set":35},"record + turn E1…E4","The movement is stored per step, like locks.",{"id":116,"goal":117,"preconditions":118,"steps":119,"result":35,"source":53,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"smooth","Glide between locked values instead of jumping",[],[120],{"keys":121,"note":35,"set":35},"bar + turn E4",{"id":123,"goal":124,"preconditions":125,"steps":126,"result":35,"source":53,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"clear","Remove all locks from the pattern but keep its notes",[],[127],{"keys":128,"note":35,"set":35},"bar + M2",{"id":130,"goal":131,"preconditions":132,"steps":133,"result":35,"source":45,"firmware_min":35,"verified_on":35,"confidence":46},"copy-step","Copy a step, locks included, to another step",[],[134],{"keys":135,"note":136,"set":35},"hold step n → step m","let go of the first step, then press the target step, which must be empty",[],[139,140,141,142],"sequencer.step-components","sequencer.component-skip-parameter-lock","sequencer.bar-menu","instrument.engine-prism","A parameter lock pins one value of one parameter to one step. Hold a hi-hat step and open the\nfilter a little, hold the next one and close it, and the pattern gains movement without any\nrecording pass. Locks work on everything the module pages show — engine, envelopes, filter, LFO —\nbut not on player settings.\n\nLocks and live-recorded knob moves share their storage and their smoothing: both change the value\nin steps unless the bar menu's shape control (`bar + turn E4`) blends between them. To thin locks\nout over time, pair them with the skip parameter lock step component.\n\nFirmware history matters here: sampler tracks gained locks in 1.1.0, rotating a sequence has\ncarried its locks along since 1.1.21, and locks on empty steps work reliably from 1.1.33.",[145,147,149,150,151,153,154,155,156,157],{"url":40,"kind":146},"research",{"url":45,"kind":148},"guide",{"url":53,"kind":148},{"url":57,"kind":148},{"url":67,"kind":152},"changelog",{"url":71,"kind":148},{"url":75,"kind":152},{"url":79,"kind":152},{"url":83,"kind":152},{"url":87,"kind":152},[159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181],"step.1","step.2","step.3","step.4","step.5","step.6","step.7","step.8","step.9","step.10","step.11","step.12","step.13","step.14","step.15","step.16","encoder.1","encoder.2","encoder.3","encoder.4","key.record","key.bar","key.m2",{"id":12,"title":183},"Sequencer",{"id":185,"title":186},"sequencer.transpose-sequence","Transposing a track's sequence",{"id":188,"title":189},"sequencer.clear-and-undo","Clearing a sequence and undo",{"basics.key-notation":191,"basics.main-modes":192,"basics.modules":193,"basics.track-buttons":194,"basics.linked-tracks":195,"b